{
  "program": "CBTRN03C",
  "caseId": "case20",
  "description": "An abend AFTER a complete set of report records, which is the case that separates the two record channels. The first record writes four headers and a detail line; the second carries TRAN-TYPE-CD '77', which 1500-B-LOOKUP-TRANTYPE cannot resolve, so the run abends at :500 having already written five records. app/jcl/TRANREPT.jcl:76-80 declares TRANREPT as DISP=(NEW,CATLG,DELETE), whose second and third positionals are different outcomes: a run that reaches 9999-GOBACK leaves the report catalogued, and a run that does not must leave no report at all. So the writes channel carries five records and the final state carries none - the dataset exists at its declared 133 bytes and holds nothing. No account, page or grand total is written, because none of those paragraphs is reached.",
